{"unit_id":"Sama05__dsh-download-progress#card-zh","repo":"Sama05/dsh-download-progress","commit":"0030d323ec6865f71e3738c5ab50de0790fbe314","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-download-progress 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的进度显示插件。它观察 DSH 工具调用并估算下载或安装任务的进展，也可显示网页抓取、搜索和后台任务状态。插件在窗口顶部呈现可堆叠的浮层，并提供嵌入对话输入区的简易条；任务可按会话分组，设置中可调整显示方式、主题和条数。适合需要了解长时间工具调用进度的 DSH 用户。无需额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:227-259","src/client/99-plugin.js:26-55"]}
{"unit_id":"Sama05__dsh-download-progress#card-en","repo":"Sama05/dsh-download-progress","commit":"0030d323ec6865f71e3738c5ab50de0790fbe314","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-download-progress shows progress in DSH web. It observes tool calls to estimate download and install progress and displays fetch, search, and background task status. Users can choose an overlay or compact bar, group tasks by session, and adjust settings. No account or API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:227-259","src/client/99-plugin.js:26-55"]}
